            <p>By using the Glitched Network website, Minecraft server, or community spaces, you agree to follow these terms and the server rules.</p>

            <h2>Access</h2>
            <p>Access to Glitched Network is provided at staff discretion. We may restrict, suspend, or remove access for rule violations, abuse, security concerns, or behavior that harms the community.</p>

            <h2>Gameplay And Content</h2>
            <p>You are responsible for what you say, build, trade, upload, or otherwise contribute. Do not submit content that is illegal, hateful, malicious, or intended to disrupt the server.</p>

            <h2>Purchases And Rewards</h2>
            <p>If paid perks, donations, giveaways, or rewards are offered, they do not grant permission to break rules. Benefits may change if required for balance, technical reasons, or server health.</p>

            <h2>Availability</h2>
            <p>The server and website may change, restart, reset, or go offline. We work to preserve player progress, but no online service can guarantee permanent availability or loss-free operation.</p>

            <h2>Updates</h2>
            <p>These terms may be updated as the server changes. Continued use of Glitched Network means you accept the latest version posted here.</p>
        </article>
    </main>
</MainLayout>
